[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:50. Taken for a Ride]
[00:00.540]Passage 50 | 文章五十
[00:02.595]Taken for a ride. | 被带去兜圈子。
[00:06.150]I love travelling in the country, | 我喜欢在乡村旅行，
[00:10.100]but I don't like losing my way. | 但我不喜欢迷路。
[00:13.460]I went on an excursion recently, | 我最近去郊游了，
[00:16.805]but my trip took me longer than I expected. | 但我的行程比我预期的要长。
[00:21.340]I'm going to Woodford Green, | 我要去伍德福德格林，
[00:24.460]I said to the conductor as I got on the bus. | 我上车时对售票员说。
[00:28.120]But I don't know where it is. | 但我不知道它在哪里。
[00:31.165]I'll tell you where to get off, | 我会告诉你哪里下车，
[00:34.055]answered the conductor. | 售票员回答。
[00:36.390]I sat in the front of the bus | 我坐在公共汽车的前面，
[00:39.470]to get a good view of the countryside. | 以便更好地欣赏乡村景色。
[00:42.965]After some time, | 一段时间后，
[00:45.270]the bus stopped. | 公共汽车停了下来。
[00:47.335]Looking round, | 环顾四周，
[00:49.240]I realised with a shock | 我惊讶地发现
[00:51.510]that I was the only passenger left on the bus. | 我是车上唯一剩下的乘客。
[00:56.180]You'll have to get off here, | 你必须在这里下车，
[00:59.110]the conductor said. | 售票员说。
[01:01.025]This is as far as we go. | 我们就到这儿了。
[01:04.320]Is this Woodford Green? | 这里是伍德福德格林吗？
[01:07.415]I asked. | 我问道。
[01:09.115]Oh dear, | 哦，天哪，
[01:10.840]said the conductor suddenly. | 售票员突然说。
[01:12.885]I forgot to put you off. | 我忘了让你下车了。
[01:15.915]It doesn't matter, | 没关系，
[01:18.105]I said, | 我说，
[01:19.020]I'll get off here. | 我就在这里下车吧。
[01:21.255]We are going back now, | 我们现在要回去了，
[01:23.675]said the conductor. | 售票员说。
[01:25.275]Well, in that case, | 嗯，既然如此，
[01:27.265]I prefer to stay on the bus. | 我宁愿留在车上。
[01:29.715]I answered. | 我回答道。